WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:08.260
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.130 --> 00:14.170
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.820 --> 00:19.080
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him,
 his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:19.080 --> 00:20.440
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as</i>

00:20.440 --> 00:23.550
<i>"death incarnate that dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.140 --> 00:29.210
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

00:31.010 --> 00:33.970
Cuff, you're a pretty good cook.

00:34.990 --> 00:36.000
Am I?

00:38.850 --> 00:42.500
You can make it for me the rest 
of your life, if you want.

00:42.500 --> 00:44.990
<i>Ooh, that sounded kind of 
like a marriage proposal!</i>

00:46.010 --> 00:48.610
No, that'd be a lot of work.

00:49.990 --> 00:52.070
Oh...

02:27.000 --> 02:31.020
Episode 20
The Duke, Alice, and the Kissing Window

02:27.600 --> 02:33.920
<i>Hey there, it's Viola!</i>

02:34.990 --> 02:41.560
<i>Today, I've come to town 
to see Cuff in the circus!</i>

02:41.560 --> 02:43.600
Welcome, Viola!

02:44.340 --> 02:48.030
Cuff's taking care of our new lion.

02:48.030 --> 02:50.050
Why did you get a lion?

02:50.050 --> 02:52.920
We went to the town zoo a while back,

02:52.920 --> 02:55.730
and they didn't have a lion.

02:56.180 --> 03:01.270
I told the Ringmaster, and he said that 
meant if we got one, everybody would love it.

03:01.270 --> 03:03.100
And before you know it...

03:04.780 --> 03:06.340
Sounds dangerous, though.

03:06.340 --> 03:07.600
It's a real lion, right?

03:07.600 --> 03:08.560
Yeah, I guess.

03:08.560 --> 03:10.660
It seems to be getting 
along with Cuff for now.

03:11.320 --> 03:11.920
Here.

03:11.920 --> 03:12.830
Hey!

03:12.830 --> 03:13.940
Cuff, how are you doing?

03:13.940 --> 03:15.640
She's dead!

03:15.640 --> 03:18.350
Oh, is that you, Viola?

03:18.350 --> 03:19.910
Thanks for coming!

03:19.910 --> 03:21.040
Shocking content warning!

03:21.040 --> 03:21.870
No looking!

03:21.870 --> 03:23.950
One sec, I'll get out.

03:28.220 --> 03:29.140
Sorry to keep you waiting.

03:29.140 --> 03:31.450
What's with that smile?

03:31.450 --> 03:33.060
Anyway, are you okay?

03:33.360 --> 03:36.330
Yes, it seems to really like me.

03:36.330 --> 03:37.460
Don't worry.

03:37.460 --> 03:40.330
It probably thinks of me 
like a parent or a sister.

03:41.230 --> 03:43.530
<i>No, I think it thinks of you as food.</i>

03:43.870 --> 03:48.790
Since Viola's here, why don't you go 
have fun in town until the show starts?

03:48.790 --> 03:50.920
That's a great idea!

03:50.920 --> 03:52.570
Viola, let's go!

03:52.570 --> 03:54.250
Sure, I guess.

03:54.250 --> 03:56.710
Okay, I'll get ready!

03:57.810 --> 04:00.730
<i>I think Cuff has taken a liking to me.</i>

04:00.730 --> 04:02.550
<i>Well, I guess that's okay.</i>

04:02.550 --> 04:04.170
Where should we go, Viola?

04:04.170 --> 04:05.870
Shopping? Maybe a café?

04:05.870 --> 04:07.390
Calm down.

04:07.390 --> 04:09.150
Let's take a look around first.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.890
Oh wow, that's really cute!

04:13.350 --> 04:15.800
It's been a while since I've been in town.

04:15.800 --> 04:18.270
I've barely left the house lately.

04:18.570 --> 04:20.290
What are you doing at home?

04:20.290 --> 04:22.250
Studying every single day.

04:22.250 --> 04:24.530
Nobles have a lot less free 
time than you'd think.

04:24.530 --> 04:27.780
So it makes me really happy to be 
able to hang out with a friend—

04:28.280 --> 04:30.800
No, I'm just making sure 
you're not lonely, Cuff!

04:30.800 --> 04:32.290
Don't get the wrong idea, okay?

04:33.120 --> 04:35.480
You're a tsundere, aren't you?

04:36.300 --> 04:37.970
I-I know, Cuff.

04:37.970 --> 04:40.250
Let me pick out an outfit for you.

04:40.250 --> 04:42.340
Really? That'd be great.

04:42.340 --> 04:43.430
Leave it to me!

04:43.430 --> 04:45.800
Kneel before my fashion sense!

04:50.810 --> 04:52.350
You put it on okay?

04:52.350 --> 04:54.990
No, I have no idea how to put it on.

04:55.310 --> 04:56.150
Show me.

04:56.500 --> 05:00.040
Y-You dummy! Why'd you take your underwear off?

05:00.040 --> 05:01.030
Oh, right.

05:02.840 --> 05:05.610
<i>I'm glad the clerk didn't see her.</i>

05:05.950 --> 05:08.440
<i>Her boobs were popping out like 4D!</i>

05:10.280 --> 05:11.510
Viola...

05:11.950 --> 05:13.290
Help me get it on.

05:15.090 --> 05:18.250
It's got to be hard for Zain to 
take care of you all the time.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.110
Maybe.

05:20.110 --> 05:21.390
I'm grateful to him.

05:23.790 --> 05:25.170
And there you go.

05:25.640 --> 05:27.030
Look in the mirror.

05:33.930 --> 05:34.770
Well?

05:34.770 --> 05:36.410
This is great!

05:36.410 --> 05:38.420
You really do have good fashion sense!

05:38.420 --> 05:40.370
Right? I'm pretty confident.

05:40.370 --> 05:43.340
Why not go pro someday?

05:43.340 --> 05:45.710
You could be a fashion 
designer or something.

05:45.710 --> 05:49.530
Not happening. I'm a noblewoman, you know.

05:49.530 --> 05:51.880
My future's already been decided.

05:51.880 --> 05:54.080
I'm too old for dreams.

05:54.420 --> 05:56.290
Why not do it and then worry about it?

05:58.050 --> 05:59.790
Oh, look at the time!

05:59.790 --> 06:02.220
Once we pay for this, 
we'll head back to the circus.

06:02.220 --> 06:05.310
If I see you in the seats, 
I'll blow you a kiss!

06:05.310 --> 06:06.540
Right, right!

06:15.400 --> 06:17.590
<i>She's like a totally different person.</i>

06:17.590 --> 06:20.650
<i>The center of attention, 
the girl everyone loves...</i>

06:22.450 --> 06:23.860
<i>She's so amazing.</i>

06:32.910 --> 06:35.490
<i>And what's with that smile?</i>

06:45.960 --> 06:50.470
Walter, I never thought I'd see you here.

06:50.900 --> 06:51.640
Are you okay?

06:51.640 --> 06:52.940
Shut up, scum!

06:52.940 --> 06:54.670
Seems like he's okay!

06:54.670 --> 06:55.430
Yeah.

06:56.220 --> 07:00.740
Thanks for untying me, but... 
are you sure that's a good idea?

07:00.740 --> 07:02.020
I don't mind.

07:02.420 --> 07:05.440
You've come to hear the 
rest of the story, right?

07:05.440 --> 07:06.010
Yes.

07:06.010 --> 07:07.310
About my mother...

07:10.500 --> 07:11.990
Follow me.

07:11.990 --> 07:13.280
I want to show you something.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.670
You're sure it's not a t-trap?

07:16.170 --> 07:17.480
Wimp!

07:17.480 --> 07:20.820
This is why you're not cut out to be heir.

07:20.820 --> 07:23.000
He's lower than a wimp. He's a maggot.

07:23.000 --> 07:25.410
That's going too far, isn't it?

07:25.410 --> 07:27.400
Your Grace, let's get going too.

07:29.780 --> 07:33.890
I hate to admit it, but yes, 
I lack experience as a person.

07:33.890 --> 07:35.930
You're a lot more courageous than me.

07:36.730 --> 07:39.040
I'd love to let you be heir.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.580
"Let me" be heir?

07:41.040 --> 07:43.200
Did I say something weird?

07:43.200 --> 07:45.730
Walter is correct in every way.

07:45.730 --> 07:47.830
You're taking his side a little 
too much, don't you think?

07:47.830 --> 07:50.190
I really do hate you!

07:50.520 --> 07:53.200
I need to beat you to become 
the heir, or there's no point!

07:53.590 --> 07:57.870
You're selfish, arrogant, 
and completely lacking in self-awareness!

07:57.870 --> 08:00.470
The first thing I'm gonna do when I break 
your curse is punch you in the face!

08:00.470 --> 08:02.160
That's really harsh.

08:03.200 --> 08:05.480
You can just punch me back.

08:05.480 --> 08:07.130
That's what siblings do.

08:07.690 --> 08:09.090
<i>Siblings...</i>

08:10.020 --> 08:12.090
You and I are the same.

08:13.060 --> 08:15.180
<i>Maybe that's right.</i>

08:15.180 --> 08:19.200
<i>If I didn't try to do everything 
she said, if I argued...</i>

08:22.010 --> 08:26.270
<i>Why am I blushing while looking 
at this human child?</i>

08:27.070 --> 08:30.450
I couldn't just ignore a crying lady.

08:30.880 --> 08:34.240
You're beautiful...

08:35.020 --> 08:39.830
<i>That's way too much for a girl who's 
been in mourning for over 150 years!</i>

08:40.820 --> 08:42.750
<i>He needs to take responsibility.</i>

08:52.250 --> 08:53.470
What is this place?

08:54.170 --> 08:56.370
I can't say I like the interior decorating...

08:56.370 --> 08:57.840
Is there a mummy or something in here?

08:58.200 --> 08:59.470
Silence.

09:03.580 --> 09:06.990
Alice, this is what I wanted to show you.

09:16.420 --> 09:18.030
Mother...

09:28.720 --> 09:30.380
Mother...

09:30.380 --> 09:32.450
This is... Sharon?

09:32.830 --> 09:34.390
Alice's mother?

09:34.390 --> 09:37.080
As I said, she's alive.

09:37.080 --> 09:39.810
She's simply been asleep for a long time.

09:39.810 --> 09:41.270
That's impossible.

09:41.270 --> 09:44.410
Her supposed death in an accident was a lie

09:44.410 --> 09:46.960
told to you by the one-eyed man.

09:48.430 --> 09:52.850
I'm a mean witch, but this 
isn't an illusion or a lie.

09:52.850 --> 09:56.190
Why not pinch yourself to make sure?

10:00.610 --> 10:02.490
She's not cold.

10:02.490 --> 10:04.290
Mother... Mother!

10:04.290 --> 10:05.360
It won't help.

10:05.360 --> 10:07.050
She won't wake up.

10:07.940 --> 10:09.540
This, too, is my sister's curse.

10:11.030 --> 10:13.330
Just like you can't break the boy's curse,

10:13.330 --> 10:15.840
her curse is unbreakable as well.

10:16.320 --> 10:18.300
My sister was a magical genius.

10:18.570 --> 10:21.930
How did Sade die, then?

10:22.640 --> 10:24.890
I want to know the answer myself.

10:25.480 --> 10:28.240
Sharon might know.

10:28.240 --> 10:30.100
That's why I want to wake her up.

10:30.850 --> 10:33.370
I did quite like her too.

10:34.570 --> 10:35.780
What are you doing?

10:37.010 --> 10:39.150
Can't I take her home?

10:39.800 --> 10:41.690
If something happens, will you
 be able to deal with it?

10:42.190 --> 10:45.370
She's safer with me, I think.

10:45.600 --> 10:48.180
You're right... aren't you?

10:48.180 --> 10:50.650
You've been looking after her for so long.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.400
Please take care of her.

10:53.950 --> 10:55.840
I'll come back, I promise.

10:56.710 --> 10:58.910
Do you have any other questions?

10:58.910 --> 11:01.550
Today's a special day, so I'll 
talk to you a little more.

11:01.550 --> 11:02.930
Really?

11:02.930 --> 11:05.850
Then tell me everything 
you know about my curse!

11:05.850 --> 11:07.640
What a greedy young man!

11:08.410 --> 11:14.060
First, I want to know what happened at our 
home during the time when he was cursed.

11:14.060 --> 11:14.560
Very well.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.610
No hesitation!

11:16.250 --> 11:18.650
I'll show you my memories.

11:20.970 --> 11:22.760
This is our home?

11:22.760 --> 11:24.870
She used magic to create an illusion?

11:25.090 --> 11:27.270
What you see before you is your old home,

11:27.270 --> 11:31.290
as it was just a short 
time before you were cursed.

11:31.290 --> 11:33.840
Who called me a tour guide? 
I'll kill you for saying that.

11:33.840 --> 11:35.840
Nobody said a word.

11:37.300 --> 11:39.230
You're too slow, little brother.

11:39.230 --> 11:41.200
Wait, big brother!

11:41.200 --> 11:42.870
Wait, I'm the little brother?

11:42.870 --> 11:45.760
You make such a cute second son, Your Grace.

11:45.760 --> 11:49.630
Since this is an illusion, 
I made you the eldest.

11:49.630 --> 11:52.850
<i>I appreciate it, but this just makes 
everything worse, so please change it back.</i>

11:55.100 --> 11:57.770
Sharon! Sharon!

11:57.770 --> 11:59.560
Oh, Your Grace!

12:00.010 --> 12:01.990
What's Alice doing today?

12:02.300 --> 12:05.450
She's relaxing in her room.

12:05.450 --> 12:06.640
Okay!

12:06.640 --> 12:07.750
Thanks!

12:08.420 --> 12:12.450
<i>My mother is talking. My mother is laughing.</i>

12:20.240 --> 12:24.750
And that's my sister, Sade.

12:25.190 --> 12:27.510
The shivering girl behind her is me.

12:28.580 --> 12:30.470
<i>That's Sade...</i>

12:31.530 --> 12:34.190
<i>The strongest witch, the one who cursed me.</i>

12:35.150 --> 12:37.770
<i>What do those eyes see?</i>

12:38.840 --> 12:44.320
<i>After this, Sade curses me 
and puts Sharon to sleep.</i>

12:44.730 --> 12:46.100
<i>But why?</i>

12:48.200 --> 12:50.130
What's wrong? Are you okay?

12:50.540 --> 12:51.580
Yes.

12:51.580 --> 12:56.460
It's just an illusion I made, 
but I'm scared of my sister.

12:56.670 --> 12:59.790
I guess I'm not over it after all.

13:00.990 --> 13:03.290
It's okay. Break the spell.

13:06.490 --> 13:09.090
I'll keep giving you information.

13:09.550 --> 13:12.040
So please don't come to the Sabbath again.

13:12.040 --> 13:12.890
Okay.

13:12.890 --> 13:17.850
And Walter... may I come to see you soon?

13:17.850 --> 13:18.860
Sure, I guess.

13:19.770 --> 13:21.020
Farewell.

13:31.540 --> 13:33.030
Where are we?

13:33.030 --> 13:34.620
The mansion.

13:35.090 --> 13:38.920
It seems she sent us home.

13:38.920 --> 13:39.840
I see...

13:40.930 --> 13:43.070
Anyway, we got a lot out of that.

13:43.070 --> 13:45.310
We learned that Sharon is alive.

13:45.310 --> 13:46.360
Yes.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.800
That was my mother.

13:48.480 --> 13:51.260
I remember her scent.

13:51.490 --> 13:53.870
They were cast by the same witch,

13:53.870 --> 13:57.290
so if we can break my curse, 
I'm sure we can wake her up, too.

13:57.690 --> 13:59.600
That's one more goal we've got, huh?

14:02.650 --> 14:05.320
And my opinion of Daleth changed too.

14:05.630 --> 14:07.480
I used to just be scared of her.

14:07.480 --> 14:10.760
But now I think that maybe we can trust her.

14:10.760 --> 14:12.570
I agree.

14:12.950 --> 14:14.790
Do you think we can be friends?

14:17.920 --> 14:20.570
Ever since I met Cuff and Zain,
 I've been thinking...

14:20.940 --> 14:24.470
Maybe you can be friends 
with witches, just like humans.

14:25.760 --> 14:29.680
All the people in the circus accepted 
me without being afraid of me.

14:30.440 --> 14:36.390
So I want to make friends with lots of 
witches and humans instead of being scared.

14:37.810 --> 14:38.850
Is that weird?

14:39.150 --> 14:42.560
Your Grace, it's not weird at all.

14:42.830 --> 14:47.230
I'm so glad I get to be by your side.

14:47.230 --> 14:48.650
R-Really?

14:49.480 --> 14:54.240
Hey, do you think Walter made it home okay?

14:55.950 --> 14:59.800
I'm going to ruin him and take over as heir!

14:59.800 --> 15:02.690
Feel free to admire me even more, Viola!

15:02.690 --> 15:04.170
God, you're creepy!

15:05.370 --> 15:06.630
What?

15:09.450 --> 15:11.800
Is that really where you're 
supposed to put that?

15:11.800 --> 15:13.630
What do you think it is?

15:14.030 --> 15:17.030
Something else Zain brought?

15:17.030 --> 15:18.560
Some weird magic thing.

15:19.050 --> 15:20.310
Correct!

15:21.770 --> 15:25.310
Is this one of those things where 
the genie comes out if you rub it?

15:25.310 --> 15:26.780
Perhaps.

15:27.650 --> 15:30.490
Rub it. Hard.

15:30.700 --> 15:32.950
Why are you saying that in my ear?

15:33.660 --> 15:36.550
Maybe it'll grant us three wishes.

15:36.550 --> 15:39.290
Come forth, genie of the lamp!

15:45.920 --> 15:48.000
You called, human?

15:49.160 --> 15:51.130
Alice, did you get a part-time job?

15:51.130 --> 15:54.120
No. I have no form of my own.

15:54.120 --> 15:57.410
So I've taken hers. That's all.

15:57.410 --> 16:00.850
His Grace does love ethnic outfits.

16:00.850 --> 16:03.540
S-Stop it...

16:04.260 --> 16:05.560
What's with these two?

16:05.840 --> 16:07.160
Well, whatever.

16:07.570 --> 16:12.280
Give me your three wishes, 
I guess, and I'll grant them.

16:12.890 --> 16:16.630
I like it! It feels like 
Alice is talking down to me!

16:16.630 --> 16:18.240
<i>You can grant any wish?</i>

16:18.600 --> 16:21.200
You said the wrong part of that out loud.

16:21.890 --> 16:25.330
If you can grant any wish, 
then break my curse.

16:25.330 --> 16:25.920
Okay. I'll do it.

16:26.170 --> 16:27.130
You will?

16:27.750 --> 16:32.080
Nanja-hoi-honjaran-monja-monja-monja...

16:32.080 --> 16:33.840
That's a really weird chant!

16:34.210 --> 16:34.840
Done.

16:35.770 --> 16:37.870
Your curse is gone.

16:37.870 --> 16:39.360
Just with that weird spell?

16:39.360 --> 16:40.330
Really?

16:40.720 --> 16:43.190
I can't really believe it...

16:43.190 --> 16:46.670
I'll prove it. Your second wish.

16:52.580 --> 16:53.550
Oh my.

16:53.550 --> 16:54.770
It's not wilting...

16:55.380 --> 16:58.160
Then I can touch Alice, too?

16:59.000 --> 17:01.350
I s-still can't believe you, though!

17:01.350 --> 17:03.630
It's this really powerful curse!

17:03.630 --> 17:05.010
It's not easy to break...

17:05.010 --> 17:06.970
It was powerful, yes.

17:07.380 --> 17:11.880
It was hard to break it entirely... 
so I moved it to someone else.

17:13.470 --> 17:18.090
I forced somebody else somewhere 
out there to bear your curse.

17:18.090 --> 17:20.460
It was the only way.

17:20.460 --> 17:21.820
Wait!

17:21.820 --> 17:26.170
Then that person's going 
to suffer from that curse?

17:26.170 --> 17:29.040
Not being able to touch anyone or be touched...

17:29.040 --> 17:32.900
Yes. But that's not your problem.

17:32.900 --> 17:34.600
What do you care?

17:34.600 --> 17:37.530
Now state your third wish.

17:55.270 --> 17:57.220
You're sure, Your Grace?

17:57.500 --> 17:58.710
It's okay.

17:58.710 --> 18:02.110
I don't want to be happy if it 
means making someone else suffer.

18:02.110 --> 18:03.430
I'm sure I'd regret it.

18:03.980 --> 18:06.860
I never expected anything 
from it, so it's okay.

18:06.860 --> 18:09.440
I got to see you in a cute ethnic outfit.

18:09.440 --> 18:12.150
The way you think is wonderful, Your Grace.

18:12.150 --> 18:14.160
Thanks. Too close.

18:14.500 --> 18:19.360
Hmm? I was going to do some trimming, 
but this area's all wilted.

18:19.680 --> 18:22.890
Perhaps I've awakened to 
some kind of special power?

18:23.300 --> 18:25.330
I'll do it again.

18:27.750 --> 18:29.710
Like this? Like this? Or this?

18:29.710 --> 18:31.950
How about this? Or this?

18:31.950 --> 18:34.580
Maybe this? Or this?

18:37.690 --> 18:40.930
Aw, so Cuff and Zain are gonna date?

18:41.170 --> 18:42.640
Hey, did you kiss already?

18:42.640 --> 18:44.380
Well, you see...

18:44.380 --> 18:46.890
Well... um...

18:47.140 --> 18:49.780
Aw, they did kiss!

19:15.490 --> 19:17.550
What are you putting on your lips?

19:18.110 --> 19:21.180
Lip balm, to keep my lips moist.

19:21.850 --> 19:26.010
Now I'm ready for you to 
kiss me whenever you want.

19:26.240 --> 19:27.880
You know I can't do that!

19:27.880 --> 19:30.090
You want some, too?

19:30.090 --> 19:33.230
N-No thanks. It'd be an indirect kiss.

19:34.260 --> 19:36.230
Of course, you can have a new one.

19:36.580 --> 19:39.690
I'm so embarrassed I could die!

19:40.390 --> 19:43.100
You can use mine too, if you like.

19:43.100 --> 19:46.490
Don't be so mean...

19:51.120 --> 19:53.520
You don't need to see me to the door.

19:53.840 --> 19:55.390
You'll catch a cold.

19:55.390 --> 19:57.100
It's just something I want to do.

19:57.100 --> 19:58.090
Don't worry about it.

19:58.910 --> 20:01.060
I'm bad with goodbyes...

20:01.060 --> 20:04.680
I know I'll see you tomorrow, 
but it still makes me sad.

20:05.010 --> 20:09.610
Then think about me as you do it tonight.

20:11.120 --> 20:13.850
Writing your poems, I mean.

20:14.480 --> 20:16.860
Well, goodnight, Alice!

20:16.860 --> 20:19.040
Don't you catch a cold either.

20:19.040 --> 20:19.640
Okay.

20:19.640 --> 20:21.700
Goodnight, Your Grace.

20:28.810 --> 20:31.130
So I want to make friends...

20:32.160 --> 20:35.550
I don't want to be happy if it 
means making someone else suffer.

20:47.380 --> 20:49.930
Alice, did you forget something?

21:51.190 --> 21:57.430
<i>My heart was racing so fast... I didn't 
even notice the coldness of the glass.</i>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
The Duke, Alice, and the Second Anniversary

23:35.730 --> 23:39.460
"The Duke, Alice, and the Second Anniversary."
